1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,150
(Sheldon:)I should think so.

2
00:00:02,150 --> 00:00:04,440
(Amy:)Then 128.

3
00:00:11,890 --> 00:00:15,380
(Leonard:)Okay, come on.

4
00:00:15,380 --> 00:00:17,560
(Leonard:)Almost there.

5
00:00:22,770 --> 00:00:24,550
(Howard:)Don't tug.
No tugging.

6
00:00:24,560 --> 00:00:27,190
(Raj:)Next time, take your own advice.

7
00:00:27,190 --> 00:00:29,360
(Sheldon(phone gives text alert):)Excuse me,
could you help us out?

8
00:00:29,360 --> 00:00:31,780
(Nurse:)My, my, my.

9
00:00:31,780 --> 00:00:33,750
(Nurse:)What do we have here?

10
00:00:35,450 --> 00:00:36,780
(Howard:)I slipped and fell.

11
00:00:36,790 --> 00:00:38,590
(Nurse:)Yeah, we get that a lot.

12
00:00:38,590 --> 00:00:41,420
(Nurse:)What is this?

13
00:00:41,420 --> 00:00:43,590
(Howard:)It's a robot arm.

14
00:00:43,590 --> 00:00:46,130
(Nurse:)Where's the rest of the robot?

15
00:00:46,130 --> 00:00:48,210
(Howard:)I only built the arm.

16
00:00:48,210 --> 00:00:50,880
'Cause that's all
you needed, right?

17
00:00:52,550 --> 00:00:54,940
(Howard:)Can you please
just help me?!

18
00:00:54,940 --> 00:00:56,220
(Nurse:)All right, all right.

19
00:00:56,220 --> 00:00:59,060
(Nurse:)Hang on, stay calm.

20
00:00:59,060 --> 00:01:01,430
(Nurse:)I need an orderly
with a wheelchair.

